            "text": "Reentrancy in ValariRouter._distribute(ValariRouter.DepositRecord,ValariRouter.Payout,IERC20,IERC20,uint256,uint256) (src/ValariRouter.sol#640-680):\n\tExternal call allowing reentrancy:\n\t- token0.safeTransfer(record.depositor,payout.amount0) (src/ValariRouter.sol#672)\n\tBalance read before the call:\n\t- balance1 = token1.balanceOf(address(this)) (src/ValariRouter.sol#649)\n\tPossible stale balance used after the call in a condition:\n\t- token0.balanceOf(address(this)) != before0 + payout.commission0 (src/ValariRouter.sol#674)\n\t\t- stale variable `REF_414`\n\t- token1.balanceOf(address(this)) != before1 + payout.commission1 (src/ValariRouter.sol#677)\n\t\t- stale variable `REF_416`\n",
            "markdown": "Reentrancy in [ValariRouter._distribute(ValariRouter.DepositRecord,ValariRouter.Payout,IERC20,IERC20,uint256,uint256)](src/ValariRouter.sol#L640-L680):\n\tExternal call allowing reentrancy:\n\t- [token0.safeTransfer(record.depositor,payout.amount0)](src/ValariRouter.sol#L672)\n\tBalance read before the call:\n\t- [balance1 = token1.balanceOf(address(this))](src/ValariRouter.sol#L649)\n\tPossible stale balance used after the call in a condition:\n\t- [token0.balanceOf(address(this)) != before0 + payout.commission0](src/ValariRouter.sol#L674)\n\t\t- stale variable `REF_414`\n\t- [token1.balanceOf(address(this)) != before1 + payout.commission1](src/ValariRouter.sol#L677)\n\t\t- stale variable `REF_416`\n"
          },
